# LEXICUM WEB FORGE — Fashion controlled vocabulary (public route)

Forge a student-facing **Fashion Lexicum** at `/lexicum/` for Creación Digital.
The page is a readable SKOS concept catalogue (Design · Business · Communication),
not a research ledger and not a lesson.

## Authority chain

```text
lexfield fields/fashion YAML  (studio vocabulary engine)
        ↓ clone (never live-mount)
digital-creativity-pedagogy/cv/data/lexicum/   ← curriculum snapshot
        ↓ compile
docs/_data/lexicum.json                       ← Jekyll data
        ↓ forge
docs/lexicum/index.md + layout/css/js         ← public HTML
```

- Curriculum-local snapshot under `cv/data/lexicum/` is what the site publishes from.
- Public data schema: **`lexfield-public/v1`** (shared with creativity-techniques-uem).
- Fashion is the **prototype tenant**; other fields reuse Field → Subfield → Concept.
- Re-sync with `digital-creativity-pedagogy/forge/scripts/sync-fashion-lexicum.py`.
- Do **not** name discontinued sibling tool repos on student HTML or in public
  captions. Upstream engine name in pedagogy docs: **lexfield** (`~/src/fieldlex`).
- Do **not** emit Ahmes / Athanor / DevIAC / local absolute paths in public HTML.
- Per-term footer: show **CIDOC-CRM mapping** and/or **scope note** only when present; never print boilerplate “SKOS · CIDOC-CRM” on every card.

## Output contract

| Artefact | Path | Published? |
| -------- | ---- | ---------- |
| Forge contract | `forge/LEXICUM-WEB-FORGE.mdc` | No |
| Execute brief | `forge/LEXICUM-WEB-FORGE.execute.md` | No |
